 40
2.5
  1
v9.9 cleaning-mode button: 16.4 hole through the bottom wall at x=83.8, Y=21.3, behind the right latch arm and clear of the channel strip. Button up through it from below, its nut on from inside, then its plug-in socket from inside (the socket will not pass through the hole). Of the socket's five wires only the two switch wires go up to the board; the other three are covered and tucked down in the bay before the battery holder goes in.
